	(descr "RF-MINIMUM-AREA 0402 (1005 metric) land for 0402WGF499JTCE (49.9 ohm 1% splitter delta, C25120). IPC-7351B LEAST (density level C): pad 0.46 x 0.51 mm at x=+/-0.45, gap 0.44 mm - NOT the IPC-NOMINAL 0.54 x 0.64 at +/-0.51 that KiCad's stock Resistor_SMD:R_0402_1005Metric carries. -32% pad area = -0.0206 pF of shunt capacitance to the L2 plane per pad on the 0.2104 mm 7628 prepreg (638 vs 415 ohm at 6 GHz against a 50 ohm line). Use ONLY on parts that sit in the 50 ohm path; every other 0402 on this board uses the stock nominal land.")
